      {
       "text": "Pioneers,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "While this isn't a Steam update, we did want to let people know that a patch to fix a major Xbox save issue went live today.",
